{"abstract":"The workshop was organized at the EASST2018 Conference to take stock of empirical insights and conceptual developments around the notion of infrastructuring in STS. We report on the collective process that aimed to critically map and disentangle assumptions, identify blind spots, and chart the varied uses of the notion in STS. By using a hands-on approach inspired by Participatory Design, the workshop contributes to the quest for new ways of thinking and inventing, in addition to proposing formats where collective conceptual experimentation could take place in cross-disciplinary settings.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Baker, Karen","Botero, Andrea","Geirbro, Hanne Cecilie","Karasti, Helena","Marttila, Sanna-Maria","Parmiggiani, Elena","Saad-Sulonen, Joanna"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-383046"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Finland"],"glorg":["Aalto University","All Global Affiliations","University of Oulu"],"keyword":["Infrastructuring","STS","Workshop"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"what does infrastructuring look like in sts when workshop report","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dra","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://easst.net/article/what-does-infrastructuring-look-like-in-sts-when-workshop-report/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-383046","ids":["itu-7876e63a-b3ce-4904-aa63-f90e0ccec24c"],"keyword":["Infrastructuring","STS","workshop"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-0432BF869F15F2DA687BA38AD721BFBE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://easst.net/article/what-does-infrastructuring-look-like-in-sts-when-workshop-report/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"fi","key":"university of oulu","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Oulu","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"fi","key":"aalto university","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Aalto University","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design","IT University of Copenhagen, Human-Computer Interaction and Design, Co-Design"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Karen","key":"bakerpau","last":"Baker","name":"Baker, Karen","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Andrea","key":"boteropau","last":"Botero","name":"Botero, Andrea","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Hanne Cecilie","key":"geirbropau","last":"Geirbro","name":"Geirbro, Hanne Cecilie","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Helena","key":"karastipau","last":"Karasti","name":"Karasti, Helena","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Sanna-Maria","key":"marttilapau","last":"Marttila","locid":"528393a3-e784-47a8-85be-c81d44c393bd","name":"Marttila, Sanna-Maria","orcid":"0000-0003-3793-5021","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Elena","key":"parmiggianipau","last":"Parmiggiani","name":"Parmiggiani, Elena","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Joanna","key":"saadsulonenpau","last":"Saad-Sulonen","name":"Saad-Sulonen, Joanna","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Vicky","key":"singletonpedh","last":"Singleton","name":"Singleton, Vicky","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Richard","key":"tuttonpedh","last":"Tutton","name":"Tutton, Richard","rank":9,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"status":"p","title":"EASST Review","volume":"37"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-7876e63a-b3ce-4904-aa63-f90e0ccec24c"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"What does infrastructuring look like in STS? When? : Workshop Report","type":"Report Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-383046","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"We invite the PD community to take stock of empirical insights and conceptual developments around the notions of infrastructure and infrastructuring. We propose that by leveraging the original relational nature of these concepts, we can revitalize the political soul of PD and better characterize the politics of participation in digitalization phenomena and processes ongoing in all walks of life. With a hands-on approach we will collectively and critically map, disentangle assumptions, identify blind spots and outline new research opportunities charting the possibilities and limitations of an infrastructuring approach in PD at large.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Karasti, Helena","Botero, Andrea","Baker, Karen","Geirbro, Hanne Cecilie","Marttila, Sanna-Maria","Parmiggiani, Elena","Saad-Sulonen, Joanna"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-383540"],"event":{"acronym":"PDC","title":"Participatory Design Conference"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Finland","Norway"],"glorg":["Aalto University","All Global Affiliations","University of Oslo","University of Oulu"],"keyword":["Infrastructuring","Politics","Relational"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"infrastructuring in pd what does infrastructuring look like when does it look like that","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/83381474/InfrastructuringInPD_AuthorsVersion.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-383540","identifier":[{"id":"85055586341","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-9bc532b7-4acd-4c03-935c-ca3ff330d1d6"],"keyword":["Infrastructuring","Politics","Relational"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-AF3E622E33FC542D892D3BE8AD6E056D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/83381474/InfrastructuringInPD_AuthorsVersion.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"fi","key":"university of oulu","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Oulu","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"fi","key":"aalto university","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Aalto University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"no","key":"university of oslo","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Oslo","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Play, Culture, and AI, Media, Art & Design"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Helena","key":"karastipau","last":"Karasti","name":"Karasti, Helena","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Andrea","key":"boteropau","last":"Botero","name":"Botero, Andrea","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Karen","key":"bakerpau","last":"Baker","name":"Baker, Karen","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Hanne Cecilie","key":"geirbropau","last":"Geirbro","name":"Geirbro, Hanne Cecilie","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Sanna-Maria","key":"marttilapau","last":"Marttila","locid":"528393a3-e784-47a8-85be-c81d44c393bd","name":"Marttila, Sanna-Maria","orcid":"0000-0003-3793-5021","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Elena","key":"parmiggianipau","last":"Parmiggiani","name":"Parmiggiani, Elena","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Joanna","key":"saadsulonenpau","last":"Saad-Sulonen","name":"Saad-Sulonen, Joanna","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3210604.3210618","eisbn":["9781450355742"],"issn":["21505896"],"place":"New York: ACM","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery","series":"Proceedings of the Participatory Design Conference","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 15th Participatory Design Conference: Short Papers, Situated Actions, Workshops and Tutorial","volume":"2"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85055586341"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-9bc532b7-4acd-4c03-935c-ca3ff330d1d6"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Infrastructuring in PD: What Does Infrastructuring Look Like? When Does It Look Like That?","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-383540","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"In this workshop we invite participants to discuss and map techniques, approaches and principles to address processes of identification in Participatory Design endeavors. The key objective of the workshop is to present identification as process as a concept to think with, and to explore how different lenses can engage workshop participants in thinking about participatory design endeavors in connection to this concept. As the outcome the workshop participants produce set of principles for identification as process for PD work.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Jørgensen, Stina Hasse","Marttila, Sanna-Maria","Homewood, Sarah","Nilsson, Elisabet M.","Ottsen Hansen, Sofie Marie"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-383659"],"event":{"acronym":"PDC","title":"Participatory Design Conference"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Malmö University"],"keyword":["Identification","Method","Participation","Process","Workshop"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"identification as process in participatory design","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/83415435/Identification_as_Process_in_Participatory_Design_.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-383659","identifier":[{"id":"85055588855","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-a3eaedf3-5dc7-4940-aaa8-58d29ffc1d5c"],"keyword":["Identification","method","participation","process","workshop"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-CB9D3165C9733A645A83ED1B840427BE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.i